       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SUMDIGITS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 N PIC 9(9) VALUE 12345.
       01 SUM-VAL PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       01 REM PIC 9(2).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM UNTIL N = 0
               COMPUTE REM = FUNCTION MOD(N, 10)
               ADD REM TO SUM-VAL
               DIVIDE N BY 10 GIVING N
           END-PERFORM
           DISPLAY "SUM: " SUM-VAL
           STOP RUN.
